      "start_seconds": 1.03,
      "end_seconds": 8.76,
      "duration_seconds": 7.73,
      "text": "Doctor, you know, hi, where would you like me to put my coat?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.59,
      "end_seconds": 14.35,
      "duration_seconds": 4.76,
      "text": "You're alright take a seat. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 16.31,
      "end_seconds": 27.13,
      "duration_seconds": 10.82,
      "text": "mainly itchy spots all over. There's a couple of other things you know but that's the the main one"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.27,
      "end_seconds": 32.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "Tell me your medicines, please."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 34.78,
      "end_seconds": 43.58,
      "duration_seconds": 8.8,
      "text": "I take febuxostat, 80 milligrams, once a day. Alendronate. I take it once a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 44.16,
      "end_seconds": 47.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "alright, and what strength is that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 52.79,
      "end_seconds": 53.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.1,
      "text": "70 milligrams"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.47,
      "end_seconds": 59.32,
      "duration_seconds": 4.85,
      "text": "Okay give me more detail on it whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 60.43,
      "end_seconds": 75.18,
      "duration_seconds": 14.75,
      "text": "Moderate, really only calamine, and it's not much it's on and off so, and I've been feeling achy as well, for two days with feeling achy, mild, really"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.69,
      "end_seconds": 82.27,
      "duration_seconds": 5.58,
      "text": "Have you had itchy spots all over before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 84.22,
      "end_seconds": 93.91,
      "duration_seconds": 9.69,
      "text": "So yes something like this happened a couple of years ago and it went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.46,
      "end_seconds": 97.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "And what about breathlessness or being immunosuppressed?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 102.48,
      "end_seconds": 105.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "no none of those at all"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.41,
      "end_seconds": 110.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "and what about pregnancy or stiff neck?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.46,
      "end_seconds": 115.9,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "no, um, no pregnancy or stiff neck"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.92,
      "end_seconds": 119.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "has your heart given you any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 124.68,
      "end_seconds": 126.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.49,
      "text": "Nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.68,
      "end_seconds": 130.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "Have you had any surgical procedures?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 132.58,
      "end_seconds": 137.77,
      "duration_seconds": 5.19,
      "text": "yeah yes I had a varicose vein procedure last year"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.6,
      "end_seconds": 157.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Right, what about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.63,
      "end_seconds": 162.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "Yeah, I have gout, for five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.32,
      "end_seconds": 166.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.76,
      "text": "I see, go ahead"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 166.78,
      "end_seconds": 179.76,
      "duration_seconds": 12.98,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, I've had thin bones for about a year now. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.62,
      "end_seconds": 189.56,
      "duration_seconds": 8.94,
      "text": "Yes, gout is known to us, good to have that clear. Any allergies to tablets, food or anything in the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 191.49,
      "end_seconds": 195.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "No, nothing as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.22,
      "end_seconds": 208.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "have you retired yet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 210.38,
      "end_seconds": 214.79,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "I retired from the post office two years ago"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.81,
      "end_seconds": 219.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "do you follow any particular diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 221.06,
      "end_seconds": 225.22,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.8,
      "end_seconds": 227.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "do you do any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 229.43,
      "end_seconds": 231.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 246.31,
      "end_seconds": 256.26,
      "duration_seconds": 9.95,
      "text": "Doctor, I've got the readings for you. Pulse is 84 beats a minute, respiratory rate 18, pressure 113 over 72, temperature 36.5."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.95,
      "end_seconds": 257.88,
      "duration_seconds": 0.93,
      "text": "okay, noted"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.69,
      "end_seconds": 263.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "Could you come over to the couch, please?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.9,
      "end_seconds": 267.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "raise your arm for me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.62,
      "end_seconds": 280.81,
      "duration_seconds": 5.19,
      "text": "There are crops of blisters and scabs in different stages on the trunk."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 285.27,
      "end_seconds": 301.54,
      "duration_seconds": 16.27,
      "text": "You can relax now. Okay, so my impression is this: It points towards chickenpox. I'd also keep shingles in mind. I don't need to to add any tests or treatment at this point. Does all of that make sense?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 303.1,
      "end_seconds": 306.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "uh, alright, thanks, take care"
    }
  ]
